### Step 1: Retrieve series IDs using the building's Brick metadata graph
```json
{
  "name": "query_graph",
  "arguments": {
    "sparql": "PREFIX brick:<https://brickschema.org/schema/0.7#> SELECT ?ts_id WHERE { <http://building.net/building-1> <http://redacted.com/ontology/RedactedVocabolary> <http://redacted.com/ontology/hasTimeseriesId> ?ts_id . }"
  }
}
```
